    The paths are already expressed in the 108x108 viewport, centred on (54,54)
    and kept inside the 72dp safe zone, so the icon needs no group matrix. A
    translating group here used to push the mark up and to the left, which read
    as a rendering glitch on the launcher and the splash screen.
-->
